<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - Trade, wholesale sales next week.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - Trade, wholesale sales next week.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic</p>
<p>indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					    DATA		     DATE</p>
<p> Trade balance     May	  +10.4 bln DM	     July 29</p>
<p> Wholesale sales   June	 -6.2 pct y/y	  July 31/Aug 1</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
